{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02577","headline":"拟饮马长城窟 · 虞世南","name":"拟饮马长城窟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驰马渡河干，流深马渡难。\n前逢锦车使，都护在楼兰。\n轻骑犹衔勒，疑兵尚解鞍。\n温池下绝涧，栈道接危峦。\n拓地勋未赏，亡城律岂宽。\n有月关犹暗，经春陇尚寒。\n云昏无复影，冰合不闻湍。\n怀君不可遇，聊持报一飱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}